("06_synapse","### Myelin and saltatory conduction",["Myelin insulates; Na+ channels packed at nodes of Ranvier","Spike jumps node to node (saltatory) = much faster","Schwann cells = PNS, oligodendrocytes = CNS","MS = CNS myelin; Guillain-Barré = PNS gangliosides, after infection"],None),
