("08_rtk","### What an RTK is",["Outside ligand domain, ONE transmembrane helix, inside tyrosine kinase","Enzyme-coupled receptor; vs GPCR (7 passes, no enzyme)","Ligands are mostly growth factors (EGF, PDGF, FGF, NGF, VEGF, insulin)"],"60 genes / 20 subfamilies and the outside-domain types: recognize only."),
