("08_rtk","### Ras: the small GTPase",["Ras = small monomeric GTPase, lipid-anchored; GTP on, GDP off","GEF turns on (Sos), GAP turns off (NF1)","Ras is NOT the trimeric G protein"],"The superfamily list (Rheb, Rap1, Arf, Rab, Ran): skim, except Rho/Rac/Cdc42 which come back."),
